# experiment artefacts
#
# NOTE the root anchor. This was `results/` until 12 Aug, which matches a directory of that name at
# any depth. It had to become root-anchored so that traversal into ./results could be restored for
# the tracked aggregate CSVs (block at the end of this file). Un-anchoring it also un-ignored every
# nested results/ directory, 13 GB of them, so those are named explicitly below.
/results/*
experiments/**/results/
logs/
results_srv/
runs/
.claude/
dataset/README_assembled.md
dataset/wordqe_build/
# campaign artefacts: keep summaries/predictions/logs, never checkpoints
experiments/comet_qe/results/campaign/outputs/*/checkpoint-*/
experiments/comet_qe/outputs/

# local HF snapshot (307M, regenerate with snapshot_download; HF is the data authority)
dataset/hf_snapshot/
.local-scratch/          # off-cluster scratch created by cluster/env.sh

# ACL Anthology bib dump (73M, regenerate: curl -o refs/anthology.bib https://aclanthology.org/anthology.bib)
refs/anthology.bib

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Re-include the aggregate CSVs behind the paper's tables.
#
# This block must stay LAST. The last matching pattern wins, `results/*` appears twice above, and
# a negation placed before them is silently re-excluded. Three lines are needed, in this order:
#   !results/analysis/     restore directory traversal, or nothing inside can match at all
#   results/analysis/*     re-exclude every entry, including subdirectories
#   !results/analysis/*.csv  admit the CSVs at that one level, and nothing else
# Without the middle line the negation also admits every .md report and the improve/ subtree.
#
# These are kilobytes and they are what makes `bash analysis/run_all_checks.sh` run on a fresh
# clone rather than only on a populated tree. The per-instance and raw dumps beside them are
# megabytes and stay out; they ship in the evidence bundle instead
# (analysis/export_evidence_bundle.py).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
!/results/analysis/
/results/analysis/*
!/results/analysis/*.csv
/results/analysis/*_perinstance.csv
/results/analysis/llm_judge_raw*.csv
/results/analysis/domain_compare*.csv
/results/analysis/joint_qe_ape.csv
/results/analysis/wmt_meta_all*.csv

# The paper's LaTeX source is not part of this repository. If you have it, place it here (or point
# INDICQE_PAPER_TEX / INDICQE_PAPER_DIR at it) to run the checks that compare tables and prose
# figures against it; see analysis/paper_source.py.
paper/

# a separate checkout that happens to live here; never part of this repository
tiny-aya-fire_IndicQE/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Re-include the per-instance model outputs behind the paper (QE prompting, APE generations,
# learned-metric scores, MQM zero-shot) and the COMET-head campaign outputs. Like the CSV block
# above, this must stay at the end so that it wins over `/results/*`, `*.jsonl`, `**/outputs/`
# and `experiments/**/results/`. Run logs, queue status markers and checkpoints stay out.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
!/results/qe_*/
!/results/qe_*/**
!/results/ape_*/
!/results/ape_*/**
!/results/zeroshot_mqm/
!/results/zeroshot_mqm/**
!experiments/comet_qe/results/
experiments/comet_qe/results/*
!experiments/comet_qe/results/campaign/
!experiments/comet_qe/results/campaign/**
experiments/comet_qe/results/campaign/logs/
experiments/comet_qe/results/campaign/runs_status/
experiments/comet_qe/results/campaign/outputs/*/checkpoint-*/
**/*.DONE
**/*.RUNNING
